3. The authors conduct comprehensive experiments to verify this issue and provide a theoretical analysis explaining this issue.

### Weaknesses

1. The proposed method is simple and straightforward. It is not clear how the proposed method can be generalized to other machine unlearning methods. 
2. The proposed method is only evaluated on a small dataset (NEWS and BOOKS), which may not be enough to show the effectiveness of the proposed method. 
